 result←object New arg;parent;name;actions;∆style;props;newobj;∆border;stretch
⍝ Create a new Edit object

⍝ Style bits:
⍝ 0 = One line; left-justified
⍝ 1 = Centered text (4∊)
⍝ 2 = Right justified text (4∊)
⍝ 4 = Multiline
⍝ 8 = Inhibit automatic vertical scrolling (4∊)
⍝ 16 = Vertical scroll bar (4∊)
⍝ 32 = Inhibit automatic horizontal scrolling (causes word-wrapping if 4∊)
⍝ 64 = Horizontal scroll bar
⍝ 128 = Password
⍝ 256 = Lowercase
⍝ 512 = Uppercase
⍝ 1024 = Keep selection highlighted when tabbing out of field
⍝ 2048 = APL entry field
⍝ 4096 = Read only
⍝ 8192 = Allow Enter character as part of text (4∊)
⍝ 16384 = Do not select text when tabbing back to control
⍝ 524288 = Disable Past context menu (4096∊)

 (parent name)←object ⍝ Separate non-standard two-part argument
 actions←⊃¨⊆¨arg ⍝ The names of the actions that they've asked to create this object with

 (∆style ∆border)←((1↓¨arg),⊂⍬)[actions⍳'style' 'border']
 ∆border←0⌈×+/∊∆border ⋄ ∆style←##._supp.SetBitVals ∆style
 stretch←¯4 ¯4×∨/'size' 'extent'∊actions ⍝ The APL+Win control does weird things with a starting position if 'size' is specified at all
 arg←(parent:parent ⋄ stretch:stretch ⋄ border:∆border)##.##.New.Center arg
 arg,←(~'edge'⊂⍛∊actions)/⊂'edge' 1 ⍝ Edit boxes have a default 'edge'

 props←'Edit'('FieldType' 'Char')('Visible' 0) ⍝ Define properties that must be used during creation
 props,←⊂'Style'('Single' 'Multi'⊃⍨1+4∊∆style) ⍝? Create-only style
 props,←⊂'Justify'('Center' 'Right' 'Left'⊃⍨1⍳⍨1 2∊∆style) ⍝? Create-only style
 ⍝? Center or Right justification forces word-wrapping and disables horizontal scrolling (32∊∆style)
 props,←⊂'VScroll'((>/4 8∊∆style)×¯2+16∊∆style) ⍝? Create-only style
 props,←⊂'HScroll'((~32∊∆style)×¯2+64∊∆style) ⍝? Create-only style
 props,←⊂'Border'∆border ⍝ Set border upon creation ⍝? Create-only
 props,←⊂'WantsReturn'(8192∊∆style)  ⍝? (Dyalog always allows Ctrl-Enter anyway unless we suppress it?) ⍝? Create-only style
 newobj←⎕VGET(parent⍕⍛,'.',name)##.##.∆WC props ⍝ Create the actual Dyalog object with required parameters
 result←parent newobj ##.##.New.Initialize arg ⍝ Complete standard class-initialization procedure
